{
  "_comment": [
    "TMFFUN（SC 的「高级设置」总窗体，740x400，18 个页签）的控件绑定表。",
    "坐标不写在这里 —— tools/gen_tmffun.py 只从 docs/sc_layout/TMFFUN.json 取坐标，",
    "这里只写「控件是什么类型、显示什么字、落到哪个配置项」。",
    "kind 取值：label / edit / number / check / radio / combo / button / group / image。",
    "exclude 里登记不做的控件与原因，生成器会跳过它们。"
  ],
  "tabs": {
    "MlSkinTabSheet3": {
      "note": "转移文档：SC 用两个单选区分「智能转移目录」与「指定转移目录」",
      "controls": {
        "Rb_SmartMoveDocuments": {
          "kind": "radio",
          "text": "智能转移目录",
          "group": "moveDocuments",
          "binding": "optimization.documentsSmart",
          "value": "smart"
        },
        "Rb_DiyMoveDocuments": {
          "kind": "radio",
          "text": "指定转移目录",
          "group": "moveDocuments",
          "binding": "optimization.documentsSmart",
          "value": "diy"
        },
        "Lab_SmartMoveDocumentsTip": {
          "kind": "label",
          "text": "说明:自动扫描目标系统最大剩余容量的分区，如果条件不成立则不转移。"
        },
        "Lab_DiyMoveDocumentsTip": {
          "kind": "label",
          "text": "说明:转移到指定目录，如果条件不成立则执行智能转移目录机制。"
        },
        "Lab_MoveDocumentsPath": {
          "kind": "label",
          "text": "转移目录:"
        },
        "Ed_MovePath": {
          "kind": "edit",
          "text": "",
          "binding": "optimization.myDocumentsTarget"
        },
        "Btn_MoveDocuments_Open": {
          "kind": "button",
          "text": "浏览(&O)",
          "action": "browse"
        },
        "Lab_Tip_MoveDocuments": {
          "kind": "label",
          "text": "",
          "role": "status"
        },
        "Btn_MoveDocuments_Save": {
          "kind": "button",
          "text": "保存(&S)",
          "action": "save"
        },
        "Btn_MoveDocuments_Exit": {
          "kind": "button",
          "text": "退出(&E)",
          "action": "close"
        }
      }
    },
    "MlSkinTabSheet4": {
